<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115116" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυτλ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wash, bathe,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυῖα χυτλῶσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					322
				</span></i>
			:—also in 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1311
			</span></i>: mostly, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>anoint oneself after bathing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.80
			</span></i>: Medic., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυτλώσασθαι</span>
			<i>to rub oneself with a mixture of water and oil</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χύτλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.532
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>wash off from oneself, wash off,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾧ κε</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ῥόῳ</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> τόκοιο λύματα χυτλώσαιτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Jov.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
